{"id":"vod_bf_13890","vodId":"13890","provider":"bf","providerName":"暴风资源","type":2,"name":"黄金拼图第一季","name_cn":"黄金拼图第一季","date":"2013-01-01","year":"2013","region":"jp","area":"日本","platform":"日韩动漫","remarks":"完结","images":{"common":"https://p.bfvp26.com/upload/vod/20230424-15/25726a3aa853da13316cf55f043b0a22.jpg"},"summary":"大宫忍（西明日香 配音）是一位平凡的十五岁少女，黑瞳黑发，从头到尾，从里到外都是标准日本少女样貌的她，其实有过寄宿在英国家庭的经历。忍的个性成熟而又稳重，温文尔雅，但却又十分执着，有着自己的主意和想法，不会轻易动摇。　　回到日本后，忍意外的收到了一封来信，写信的是名叫爱丽丝（田中真奈美 配音）英国少女，她是忍在英国寄宿家庭房东的女儿。爱丽丝告诉忍，这一次，她决定前往日本，来忍家寄宿。追随爱丽丝而来的，是她的青梅竹马九条可怜（东山奈央 配音），拥有典型外国人样貌的她实际上是混血儿。围绕着三位活泼可爱的少女，充满了快乐和温馨的校园喜剧正式拉开序幕。","rating":{"score":0},"tags":[{"name":"日本动画"}],"sourceType":"third-party","updatedAt":"2026-06-10 03:22:01","playable":true,"episodeCount":12,"classic":true,"playGroups":[{"name":"bfzym3u8","episodes":[{"name":"第01集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf2.com/video/huangjinpintudiyiji/第01集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第02集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf2.com/video/huangjinpintudiyiji/第02集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第03集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf2.com/video/huangjinpintudiyiji/第03集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第04集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf2.com/video/huangjinpintudiyiji/第04集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第05集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf2.com/video/huangjinpintudiyiji/第05集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第06集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf2.com/video/huangjinpintudiyiji/第06集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第07集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf2.com/video/huangjinpintudiyiji/第07集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第08集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf2.com/video/huangjinpintudiyiji/第08集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第09集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf2.com/video/huangjinpintudiyiji/第09集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第10集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf2.com/video/huangjinpintudiyiji/第10集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第11集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf2.com/video/huangjinpintudiyiji/第11集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第12集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf2.com/video/huangjinpintudiyiji/第12集/index.m3u8"}]}],"snapshotAt":"2026-10-22T09:34:48.613Z"}